# SCHLAR — PROMPT 5: COMPLETE PARENT WEB PORTAL AND MOBILE APP EXPERIENCE

## 1. YOUR TASK

Continue developing the existing SCHLAR School Management System frontend demo.

Implement a complete, professional, interactive Parent Web Portal and Parent Mobile App Experience.

This is Prompt 5 of the existing 12-prompt implementation roadmap.

**Do not restart the project, replace the application architecture, or rebuild unrelated modules.** Inspect the existing codebase first, understand the implementation completed in Prompts 1–4, and extend the existing application.

The goal is to make SCHLAR simple enough for a first-time parent to use while providing the depth and reliability expected from a professional school-management platform.

This is a frontend demonstration. Build real interactions using the existing application state and data architecture. Do not claim to provide production authentication, backend authorization, real push notifications, live messaging infrastructure, payment processing, or cross-device synchronization unless these capabilities genuinely exist.

